If a patient has an abrupt-heroin-or-methadone-discontinuation then a clonidine outperforms a placebo in a withdrawal-severity-reduction.
If a patient has an abrupt-heroin-or-methadone-discontinuation then a lofexidine outperforms a placebo in a withdrawal-severity-reduction.
Every clonidine is an alpha-2-agonist.
Every lofexidine is an alpha-2-agonist.
